>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\"><code>std.testing.expectEqual</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.modf.math\"><h3><code>std.math.modf.math</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">alias</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L2\">Source line 2</a></p>\n<p>Alias of <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/#std.math\"><code>std.math</code></a></p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.modf.modf\"><h3><code>std.math.modf.modf</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">function</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L21\">Source line 21</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>Returns the integer and fractional floating-point numbers that sum to x. The sign of each\nresult is the same as the sign of x.\nIn comptime, may be used with comptime_float</p>\n<p>Special Cases:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>modf(+-inf) = +-inf, nan</li>\n<li>modf(nan)   = nan, nan</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">modf</span>(x: <span class=\"tok-kw\">anytype</span>) <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/modf/#std.math.modf.Modf\">Modf</a>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@TypeOf</span>(x))</code></pre>\n<h4>Example usage</h4><pre><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">test</span> modf {\n    <span class=\"tok-kw\">inline</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">for</span> ([_]<span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>{ <span class=\"tok-type\">f16</span>, <span class=\"tok-type\">f32</span>, <span class=\"tok-type\">f64</span>, <span class=\"tok-type\">f80</span>, <span class=\"tok-type\">f128</span> }) |T| {\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> epsilon: <span class=\"tok-type\">comptime_float</span> = <span class=\"tok-builtin\">@max</span>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1e-6</span>, <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/#std.math\">math</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/float/#std.math.float.floatEps\">floatEps</a>(T));\n\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">var</span> r: <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/modf/#std.math.modf.Modf\">Modf</a>(T) = <span class=\"tok-null\">undefined</span>;\n\n        r = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/modf/#std.math.modf.modf\">modf</a>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(T, <span class=\"tok-number\">1.0</span>));\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">1.0</span>, r.ipart);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0.0</span>, r.fpart);\n\n        r = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/modf/#std.math.modf.modf\">modf</a>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(T, <span class=\"tok-number\">0.34682</span>));\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0.0</span>, r.ipart);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectApproxEqAbs\">expectApproxEqAbs</a>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(T, <span class=\"tok-number\">0.34682</span>), r.fpart, epsilon);\n\n        r = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/modf/#std.math.modf.modf\">modf</a>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(T, <span class=\"tok-number\">2.54576</span>));\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">2.0</span>, r.ipart);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectApproxEqAbs\">expectApproxEqAbs</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0.54576</span>, r.fpart, epsilon);\n\n        r = <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/math/modf/#std.math.modf.modf\">modf</a>(<span class=\"tok-builtin\">@as</span>(T, <span class=\"tok-number\">3.9782</span>));\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectEqual\">expectEqual</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">3.0</span>, r.ipart);\n        <span class=\"tok-kw\">try</span> <a href=\"/zig-docs/en/std/testing/#std.testing.expectApproxEqAbs\">expectApproxEqAbs</a>(<span class=\"tok-number\">0.9782</span>, r.fpart, epsilon);\n    }\n}</code></pre>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.modf.Modf\"><h3><code>std.math.modf.Modf</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">type-function</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L7\">Source line 7</a></p>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">pub</span> <span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">Modf</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n<h4>Parameters</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n<h4>Fields</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>fpart: T</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>ipart: T</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.modf.ModfTests\"><h3><code>std.math.modf.ModfTests</code></h3>\n<p class=\"api-kind\">type-function</p>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L54\">Source line 54</a></p>\n<div class=\"api-description\"><p>Generate a namespace of tests for modf on values of the given type</p>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"api-prototype\"><code><span class=\"tok-kw\">fn</span> <span class=\"tok-fn\">ModfTests</span>(<span class=\"tok-kw\">comptime</span> T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span>) <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n<h4>Parameters</h4><div class=\"api-parameters\">\n<pre><code>T: <span class=\"tok-type\">type</span></code></pre>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"api-entry\" id=\"std.math.modf.std\"><h3><code>std.math.modf.std</code></h3>\n<p